Description:
Compliance with the Tobacco Act is monitored by the National Supervisory Authority for Welfare and Health (Valvira) at a general level and by municipalities at a local level. Espoo Region Environmental Health Services monitors in its area (Espoo, Kauniainen and Kirkkonummi):

1. compliance with provisions on the sale or other supply of tobacco products, tobacco substitutes, smoking accessories, electronic cigarettes and nicotine-containing liquids and the related self-monitoring;

2. compliance with provisions on the marketing and display bans laid down in the Tobacco Act (549/2016);

3. compliance with provisions on smoking prohibitions and restrictions. Contact information:
Sale of tobacco: tupakkavalvonta@espoo.fi
Smoking bans: tupakointikieltopaatos@espoo.fi

